<%--
Image_Viewer

Displays an image attachment (the inline url) at its natural aspect ratio, bounded to the
container. Single "page"; set_page is a no-op.

Emits 'preview_loaded' {pages:1, width, height, ratio, state, attachment_id}: state 'loaded' with
the natural geometry once the image decodes, state 'failed' with zeros when it cannot be loaded
(or there is no $url to load).

Args: $url (the image source), $attachment_id (optional; echoed in the event).
--%>
<Define:Image_Viewer tag="div">
    <img $sid="img" class="Image_Viewer__img" alt="">
</Define:Image_Viewer>
